                  Request to become a partner with Sotomayor Consulting International
                </h2>
                <p class="mb-8 text-sm dark:text-neutral-400">
                  The consultation and analysis of your individual situation
                  <span class="font-semibold text-[#ba8d34]">
                    <b>has no cost.</b></span
                  > We will contact you to schedule an informative meeting
                  about our Referral Program, where we will clarify all your
                  doubts, confirm your participation and formalize your
                  management as a strategic partner of Sotomayor Consulting International.
                </p>
